    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Patch release v4.12.1. Security fix only.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hardened the external URL policy for user-supplied URLs (chat vision image/audio/video URLs, image and audio endpoints). Redirect targets are now validated on every hop, 100.64.0.0/10 and 0.0.0.0/8 are treated as non-public, and the connection goes to the address that was validated. See &lt;a class="issue-link </ns0:content>
